      "title": "BeamGAN: a physics-informed conditional generative adversarial network for Monte-Carlo-free portal dose image prediction from incident fluence maps",
      "summary": "Researchers developed BeamGAN, a physics-informed deep learning framework capable of predicting portal dose images directly from treatment planning system fluence maps. This tool aims to facilitate real-time patient-specific quality assurance without the need for intensive Monte Carlo simulations.",
